color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        result: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Function</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`return ${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">expression</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      }),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  systemPrompt: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'你是一个有用的助手，可以查询天气和进行数学计算。'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  maxSteps: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> answer</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> agent.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">run</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'北京和东京的温差是多少度？'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><p>执行轨迹：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"Step 1 — think: tool_call: weather({ city: &quot;北京&quot; })&#10;       — act:   { city: &quot;北京&quot;, temp: 28 }&#10;Step 2 — think: tool_call: weather({ city: &quot;东京&quot; })&#10;       — act:   { city: &quot;东京&quot;, temp: 32 }&#10;Step 3 — think: tool_call: calculator({ expression: &quot;32 - 28&quot; })&#10;       — act:   { result: 4 }&#10;Step 4 — think: &quot;东京 32°C 比北京 28°C 高 4 度&quot; → 无 toolCalls，循环终止\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>Step 1 — think: tool_call: weather({ city: \"北京\" })</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>       — act:   { city: \"北京\", temp: 28 }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Step 2 — think: tool_call: weather({ city: \"东京\" })</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>       — act:   { city: \"东京\", temp: 32 }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Step 3 — think: tool_call: calculator({ expression: \"32 - 28\" })</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>       — act:   { result: 4 }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Step 4 — think: \"东京 32°C 比北京 28°C 高 4 度\" → 无 toolCalls，循环终止</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"边界情况处理\">边界情况处理</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>边界情况</th>\n<th>处理策略</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>模型返回未注册的工具名</td>\n<td>返回错误 Observation，模型可据此修正</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>工具执行超时</td>\n<td>使用 AbortController 设置超时，返回超时错误</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>工具返回巨大结果</td>\n<td>截断结果，避免上下文窗口溢出</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>模型陷入调用循环</td>\n<td>检测重复的 toolCall 模式，强制终止</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>并行工具调用</td>\n<td><code>Promise.all</code> 并发执行同一步的多个调用</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>从零实现 ReAct 循环的核心在于三个方法：<code>think</code> 调用模型获取推理和工具请求，<code>act</code> 执行工具并收集结果（含错误处理），<code>observe</code> 将调用和结果按 <code>ModelMessage</code> 格式回填到消息历史。循环控制通过检查 <code>toolCalls</code> 是否为空来判断终止，通过 <code>maxSteps</code> 计数器来防止无限循环。手动构建这个循环让你理解了消息格式、工具执行、错误恢复和强制终止的每一个细节——这正是下一节迁移到 AI SDK Agent 抽象时需要的底层认知。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"ReAct 实现","id":"react-实现"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"从零构建 Agent Loop","id":"从零构建-agent-loop"},{"level":2,"text":"ReActAgent 完整实现","id":"reactagent-完整实现"},{"level":2,"text":"运行与执行轨迹","id":"运行与执行轨迹"},{"level":2,"text":"边界情况处理","id":"边界情况处理"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"ReAct 原理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-agent-handbook/agent-loop/react-theory"},"next":{"title":"AI SDK 6 工具循环代理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-agent-handbook/agent-loop/ai-sdk-agent"}}